    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105">

                <pb facs="0313" n="255" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg255"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Unofficial.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Señor Romero to Mr. Frederick W. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Legation</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 20, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir:</hi> In answer to your unofficial note of
                    this date informing me that “you have noticed in a St. Louis paper a letter
                    alleged to be from some point on the frontier, stating that the Marquis de
                    Montholon, who is supposed to be a son of the French minister here, had been
                    taken prisoner in the State of Durango, and shot by his captors,” and asking me
                    to communicate to you any information I might have received upon the subject, I
                    have to say that I have received, as yet, no information on the matter. Should I
                    receive any, I will be very glad to transmit it to you. If it should be
                    agreeable to you I will ask home for reliable information about that
                    intelligence.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M. ROMERO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederick</hi> W. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Seward</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c.,
                            &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
